  "notes": "USAGE:\n{呼称|こしょう} is a formal word used for official or institutional names and titles. It is more formal than {呼|よ}び{方|かた} (casual way of calling) and {名前|なまえ} (name). Common in bureaucratic, academic, and business writing.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {正式|せいしき}{呼称|こしょう}: official designation\n- {呼称|こしょう}を{変更|へんこう}する: to change the designation\n- {呼称|こしょう}が{異|こと}なる: to have different designations\n- {一般的|いっぱんてき}な{呼称|こしょう}: common designation",
